{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified OAI 6191 days before the posting",
  "headline_cites": ["E6", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Our current supply of oxycodone and acetaminophen is labeled by Bryant Ranch Prepack, a registered plant with FEI 1000519407.",
      "cites": ["E16"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 590126 at this plant ended on 2009-06-11 and was classified Official Action Indicated (OAI) with six observations including lack of a written stability program and complaint investigation deficiencies.",
      "cites": ["E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The OAI classification became known to FDA on 2009-09-09, which is 6191 days before the most recent VAI inspection known date of 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E6", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Subsequent inspections from 2010 through 2026 have all been classified Voluntary Action Indicated (VAI), with the latest inspection ending 2026-07-16 and known date 2026-10-14.",
      "cites": ["E7", "E8", "E9", "E10", "E11", "E12", "E13", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows Endo Pharmaceuticals, Inc. has a product with generic name Acetaminophen; Oxycodone Hydrochloride Tablet listed as To Be Discontinued with initial posting date 2025-11-03.",
      "cites": ["E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 32 days on hand, Corvale General has 26 days on hand, and Corvale Lakeside has 14 days on hand at current usage rates.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The best available option per rule is to buy from Alvogen, Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": []
    }
  ]
}
